From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7000: Enable the GPU on the other T7000
 boards

The iPad mini 4 (J96, J97) and the iPhone 6 and 6 Plus (N61, N56) have
the iPod touch 6's A8 GPU: the same SoC, GPU registers, power manager
and interrupts, all in t7000.dtsi. Enable the node in the two shared
board files so these boards can be tested; the driver has only run on
the iPod touch 6 so far.

The A8X (T7001) has a different GPU and is not touched.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-6.dtsi     | 4 ++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-mini4.dtsi | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-6.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-6.dtsi
index 976051b..20c2212 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-6.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-6.dtsi
@@ -72,6 +72,10 @@
 	power-domains = <&ps_disp0 &ps_mipi_dsi>;
 };
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &typhoon_opp06 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-mini4.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-mini4.dtsi
index 6e0a5ad..08d3b41 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-mini4.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7000-mini4.dtsi
@@ -171,6 +171,10 @@
 	power-domains = <&ps_disp0 &ps_dp>;
 };
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &typhoon_opp06 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
